# Spider-Punk: "Other Spiders you control have riot." Bot1 casts Spider-Punk and takes its own riot's +1/+1 counter (a 3/2),
# then Canopy Spider, which has riot as it would enter (CR 614.12a) and chooses haste. Lightning Bolt kills Spider-Punk; the
# haste the Spider gained has no duration (CR 702.136a, Rhythm of the Wild's ruling), so it still attacks on turn 1.

